292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 621 0 R
/E (AyurSafe redefines patient safety in integrative healthcare by transforming fragmented medical data into structured, clinically validated intelligence, empowering patients to navigate the intersection of allopathic and Ayurvedic treatments with confidence rather than uncertainty.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 622 0 R
/E (By combining multimodal AI for prescription digitization, knowledge graph-based reasoning for herb-drug interaction detection, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation for verified guidance, the platform delivers reliable, context-aware safety screening that moves beyond generic internet searches toward genuine clinical risk prevention.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
294 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
